<h1 data-copy-en="Monk" data-copy-zh="Monk">Monk</h1>
<p class="starter-description" data-copy-en="Monk’s four-location routine, relationship gain and one-time Perception lesson." data-copy-zh="Monk的四处日程、关系培养与一次性感知教学。">Monk’s four-location routine, relationship gain and one-time Perception lesson.</p>
<div class="wiki-source-line"><span data-copy-en="v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026" data-copy-zh="v1.0_BETAx · 2026 年 11 月 9 日更新">v1.0_BETAx · Updated 9 November 2026</span></div></div></section>
<section class="section wiki-reading-section"><div class="container wiki-reading-layout">
<aside class="wiki-toc"><div class="wiki-toc-inner"><button aria-expanded="false" class="wiki-toc-toggle" data-wiki-toc-toggle="" type="button"><span data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</span><span aria-hidden="true">+</span></button><p class="wiki-toc-heading" data-copy-en="On this page" data-copy-zh="本页目录">On this page</p><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="en" data-wiki-toc-links=""><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-overview">Overview</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-location">Where to find Monk</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-route">Route and relationship milestones</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-activities">Activities and rewards</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-troubleshooting">Missing actions and useful checks</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#en-related">Related guides</a></div><div class="wiki-toc-links" data-lang-panel="zh" data-wiki-toc-links="" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-overview">概览</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-location">出现地点与时间</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-route">路线与关系进展</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-activities">行动与奖励</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-troubleshooting">动作缺失时的检查</a><a class="wiki-toc-h2" href="#zh-related">相关指南</a></div></div></aside>
<article class="wiki-article"><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-en" data-lang-panel="en" lang="en"><section id="en-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Training_Hall_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Grace_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Three_Shared_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Spiritual_Discipline_.E2.80.94_One-Time_Perception_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Spiritual_Discipline_—_One-Time_Perception_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Daily_Room_Rotation_and_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Overview"></span><h2>Overview</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="View full screenshot: Monk — character portrait." href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/monk.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Monk — character portrait." decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/monk.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Monk — character portrait.</figcaption></figure><p>Monk moves through the Medieval monastery during the day. He offers conversation and a one-time Perception reward; shared scenes with Grace and Sabbath have their own location and relationship checks.</p></section>
<section id="en-location"><h2>Where to find Monk</h2><p>Travel to the monastery and follow the room schedule below. Monastery Scriptoria and Monastery Scriptoria (Lobby) are distinct rooms; visit the correct one rather than waiting in the other.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Location</th><th scope="col">Portrait schedule</th><th scope="col">Condition</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Monastery Scriptoria</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">06:00–10:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Illuminated Manuscript Room</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">10:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Monk's Temple Training Hall</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Monastery Scriptoria (Lobby)</th><td data-label="Portrait schedule">18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Condition"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>Windows refer to the time you start an action; the ending time is excluded.</p></section>
<section id="en-route"><h2>Route and relationship milestones</h2><p>Talk can build the Known (25) relationship required for Spiritual Discipline. The shared encounters are automatic; their scene windows do not have to match Monk’s ordinary portrait schedule.</p><details><summary>Automatic encounters: complete start conditions</summary><p>Enter the indicated location during its scene window. These encounters complete once; fixed base relationship rewards below are separate from choice bonuses. A missing hour restriction means the scene itself has no extra clock gate.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Encounter</th><th scope="col">Start location / hours</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Fixed base relationship</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Discipline Under Siege</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Monk's Temple Training Hall; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Sabbath Close Friend (200); not vacationing: Sabbath</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Sabbath +6 / Monk +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">A Gentle Reminder</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Monastery Scriptoria (Lobby); 07:00–14:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Grace Known (25); not vacationing: Grace</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Monk +4 / Grace +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Lost in Translation</th><td data-label="Start location / hours">Illuminated Manuscript Room; even days, 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Grace Acquaintance (50); not vacationing: Grace</td><td data-label="Fixed base relationship">Monk +4 / Grace +9</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="en-activities"><h2>Activities and rewards</h2><p>Talk takes 20 minutes and gives 1 actual base relationship point, with 50 safe uses daily shared across all four rooms. Spiritual Discipline is offered at the lobby portrait, 18:00–22:00: Known (25), Communication 40, 30 minutes, Perception +1 and 8 direct relationship points, once.</p><p>Listed relationship rewards are base values unless marked direct. Shared relationship modifiers can change the final gain. Daily allowances for the same action follow the character across locations; starting it elsewhere does not create a fresh allowance.</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">Action</th><th scope="col">Location / start window</th><th scope="col">Requirements</th><th scope="col">Base cost / recovery</th><th scope="col">Result / limit</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">Talk</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Monastery Scriptoria; 06:00–10:00<br/>Illuminated Manuscript Room; 10:00–14:00<br/>Monk's Temple Training Hall; 14:00–18:00<br/>Monastery Scriptoria (Lobby); 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements"></td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">20 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">base relationship +1; 50 safe uses/day</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">Spiritual Discipline</th><td data-label="Location / start window">Monastery Scriptoria (Lobby); 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="Requirements">Known (25); Communication 40</td><td data-label="Base cost / recovery">30 min</td><td data-label="Result / limit">Perception +1; direct relationship +8; once</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="en-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Troubleshooting"></span><h2>Missing actions and useful checks</h2><p>A zero shown in older action references is not his actual Talk reward. Missing Spiritual Discipline usually means the wrong room or time, insufficient Communication/relationship, or that the reward is already complete.</p></section>
<section id="en-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="Related_Pages"></span><h2>Related guides</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">Relationships, dates and intimacy</a> · <a href="character-grace.html">Grace</a> · <a href="character-sabbath.html">Sabbath</a></p></section>
</div><div class="wiki-source-content wiki-source-content-zh" data-lang-panel="zh" hidden="" lang="zh-CN"><section id="zh-overview"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Optional_Private-Client_Bookings"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Training_Hall_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Grace_Scene_Choices"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Three_Shared_Automatic_Encounters"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Spiritual_Discipline_.E2.80.94_One-Time_Perception_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Spiritual_Discipline_—_One-Time_Perception_Reward"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Daily_Room_Rotation_and_Talk"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Recommended_Walkthrough"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Quick_Stats"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Overview"></span><h2>概览</h2><figure class="reviewed-screenshot" style="max-width: 256px"><a aria-label="查看完整截图：Monk 的角色头像。" href="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/monk.webp" rel="noopener" target="_blank"><img alt="Monk 的角色头像。" decoding="async" height="175" loading="lazy" src="../assets/images/wiki/profiles/monk.webp" width="175"/></a><figcaption>Monk 的角色头像。</figcaption></figure><p>Monk每天在中世纪修道院的几处房间间活动，可以交谈，也有一次性的感知奖励。涉及Grace和Sabbath的共同事件另有地点与关系要求。</p></section>
<section id="zh-location"><h2>出现地点与时间</h2><p>前往修道院后，按下表的时间寻找。修道院抄写室与修道院抄写室（大厅）是两个不同房间，请进入正确地点，不要在另一处空等。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">地点</th><th scope="col">头像出现时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">修道院抄写室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">06:00–10:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">彩饰手稿室</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">10:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">僧侣寺院修行厅</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr><tr><th scope="row">修道院抄写室（大厅）</th><td data-label="头像出现时间">18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>时段按开始动作时判定，结束时间不包含在内。</p></section>
<section id="zh-route"><h2>路线与关系进展</h2><p>可以先靠交谈达到已知（25），再进行灵修戒律。共同事件属于自动事件，触发时段不必与Monk普通头像的日程完全重合。</p><details><summary>展开自动事件的完整开始条件</summary><p>在事件时段进入指定地点即可触发。均为一次性事件，下列固定基础关系奖励与选择奖励另算；未列额外时段表示事件本身不再加设时间限制。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">事件</th><th scope="col">开始地点／时间</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">固定基础关系奖励</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">戒律围城</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">僧侣寺院修行厅; 14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Sabbath 亲密朋友（200）；未在度假：Sabbath</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Sabbath +6、Monk +2</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">一句温和的提醒</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">修道院抄写室（大厅）; 07:00–14:00</td><td data-label="条件">Grace 已知（25）；未在度假：Grace</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Monk +4、Grace +7</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">失落在译文之间</th><td data-label="开始地点／时间">彩饰手稿室; 双数日，14:00–18:00</td><td data-label="条件">Grace 相识（50）；未在度假：Grace</td><td data-label="固定基础关系奖励">Monk +4、Grace +9</td></tr></tbody></table></div></details></section>
<section id="zh-activities"><h2>行动与奖励</h2><p>交谈消耗20分钟，实际获得1点基础关系，四个房间共用每日50次安全额度。灵修戒律在18:00—22:00的大厅头像提供，要求已知（25）、沟通40，消耗30分钟，一次性给予感知+1和8点直接关系。</p><p>除注明直接增加外，所列关系奖励均为基础值，最终增量会受共通关系修正影响。同一动作的每日额度跟随角色计算，换地点不会获得新额度。</p><div class="table-scroll"><table><thead><tr><th scope="col">动作</th><th scope="col">地点／开始时段</th><th scope="col">条件</th><th scope="col">基础消耗／恢复</th><th scope="col">结果／限制</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th scope="row">交谈</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">修道院抄写室; 06:00–10:00<br/>彩饰手稿室; 10:00–14:00<br/>僧侣寺院修行厅; 14:00–18:00<br/>修道院抄写室（大厅）; 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件"></td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">20分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">基础关系+1；50次／日安全额度</td></tr><tr><th scope="row">灵修戒律</th><td data-label="地点／开始时段">修道院抄写室（大厅）; 18:00–22:00</td><td data-label="条件">已知（25）；沟通40</td><td data-label="基础消耗／恢复">30分钟</td><td data-label="结果／限制">感知 +1；直接关系+8；一次性</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section>
<section id="zh-troubleshooting"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Troubleshooting"></span><h2>动作缺失时的检查</h2><p>旧资料里的交谈奖励0并不是实际结果。找不到灵修戒律时，请检查房间和时间、沟通与关系条件，以及是否已经取得一次性奖励。</p></section>
<section id="zh-related"><span aria-hidden="true" class="wiki-anchor-alias" id="zh-Related_Pages"></span><h2>相关指南</h2><p><a href="game-systems-relationships-dating-and-intimacy.html">关系、约会与亲密互动</a> · <a href="character-grace.html">Grace</a> · <a href="character-sabbath.html">Sabbath</a></p></section>
